sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Provider
    participant K as Composition Kernel
    participant D as Dependents

    Note over P: provider begins withdrawal

    P->>K: report withdrawal intent
    K->>K: leave NEW resolution (provider hidden from new resolves)

    K->>D: push invalidation signal

    Note over D: dependents deactivate
    D->>D: quiesce work (stop decode, park pipeline)
    D->>D: tear down bindings (SinkSession etc.)
    D->>D: discharge Effects (LIFO unwind)
    D->>D: episode closes

    D-->>K: teardown complete

    Note over K: dependents finished teardown<br/>teardown access still valid

    K->>P: ready for final release
    P->>P: remove binding / release resources
    P->>P: guard releases

    Note over P: provider finally released
